# EmbeddingGemma 2 model manifest.
#
# The GGUF files are NOT stored in git. They are downloaded on the VPS with
#   make models
# which also rewrites this file with the real SHA-256 sums.
#
# The `embed` container verifies every listed file before starting llama-server
# and refuses to start on a mismatch (see deployments/engine-entrypoint.sh).
#
# Expected files (BF16 set, per the SRS):
#   embeddinggemma-2-BF16.gguf          ggml-org/embeddinggemma-2-GGUF   (558 MB)
#   mmproj-embeddinggemma-2-BF16.gguf   AtomicChat/embeddinggemma-2-GGUF (982 MB)
#
# Optional Q8_0 fallback pair (Phase 0 comparison):
#   embeddinggemma-2-Q8_0.gguf          ggml-org/embeddinggemma-2-GGUF   (310 MB)
#   mmproj-embeddinggemma-2-Q8_0.gguf   AtomicChat/embeddinggemma-2-GGUF (555 MB)
#
# Format: <sha256>  <filename>
# Run `make manifest` after downloading to populate hashes.
